OL,3,GNEWSAFive lifeboat stations to get new
OL,4,Avessels by 2030
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive lifeboat stations in Devon are to
OL,7,Fget new vessels by 2030 as the RNLI
OL,8,Fupdates its fleet, the rescue charity
OL,9,Fsays.
OL,11,FPlymouth would be among the first
OL,12,Fstations in the country to get the new
OL,13,FCoastal design, replacing its large
OL,14,FSevern class boat; while Appledore,
OL,15,FSalcombe and Torbay would get new
OL,16,FShannon class all-weather boats, bosses
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,19,FIlfracombe would get a new Atlantic 85
OL,20,FMk3 craft, a high-speed rigid
OL,21,Finflatable, to replace its current,
OL,22,Flarger Shannon class boat, they added.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
