OL,3,GNEWSAFive lifeboat stations to get new
OL,4,Avessels by 2030
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe RNLI said data showed the majority
OL,7,Fof incidents responded to were now
OL,8,Fwithin reach of an inshore lifeboat;
OL,9,Fand 98% of responses were within 10
OL,10,Fnautical miles (11.5 miles, 18.8km) of
OL,11,Fshore between 2017 and 2025.
